{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/11ddbb69d84cbae1733f72956ead6089.avif?t=1764515034\" width=1280 height=904 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><strong>Crossdresser Killer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cTo avenge his fallen clan, he donned women\u2019s clothing.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luna, the assassin\u2014<br>the last surviving High Elf and a man of striking beauty.<br>His forest burned, his homeland taken, his comrades defiled.<br>Now, his blade of vengeance pierces the heart of the Valdoria Empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dungeon-Crawling Roguelike Action RPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character freely and lead your companions through the hellish labyrinths of the fallen empire.<br>Fight, explore, capture, and liberate\u2014every choice you make shapes a new story and fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supported Languages:</strong> Japanese / English / Simplified Chinese / Traditional Chinese / Korean</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freely combine appearance, class, and name to create your own unique character.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/333538df6de1714c6bf2798b2c0819d8.poster.avif?t=1764515034\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/333538df6de1714c6bf2798b2c0819d8.webm?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/333538df6de1714c6bf2798b2c0819d8.mp4?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A chaotic real-time battle involving dozens. Cooperate with allies and survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/e2a66631e8c544468b0026e472f2109a.poster.avif?t=1764515034\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/e2a66631e8c544468b0026e472f2109a.webm?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/e2a66631e8c544468b0026e472f2109a.mp4?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A tense close-range battle where every move counts.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/af2c8b82668f978059a2b4c6b701b59f.poster.avif?t=1764515034\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/af2c8b82668f978059a2b4c6b701b59f.webm?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/af2c8b82668f978059a2b4c6b701b59f.mp4?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A magical barrier that blocks attacks and protects allies.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/d1efc1bc4ad5a138915e9a34a7efd2e7.poster.avif?t=1764515034\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/d1efc1bc4ad5a138915e9a34a7efd2e7.webm?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/d1efc1bc4ad5a138915e9a34a7efd2e7.mp4?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u5e1d\u56fd\u306e\u652f\u914d\u3092\u8c61\u5fb4\u3059\u308b\u65bd\u8a2d\u3002\u56da\u308f\u308c\u305f\u8005\u305f\u3061\u306f\u305d\u3053\u3067\u5c48\u670d\u306e\u5100\u5f0f\u3092\u53d7\u3051\u308b\u3002</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/67efee2a144bac4c49072c120d409461.poster.avif?t=1764515034\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/67efee2a144bac4c49072c120d409461.webm?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/67efee2a144bac4c49072c120d409461.mp4?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeated ones are displayed in the plaza as symbols of the Empire\u2019s rule.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/69a64e4e4e211a38893b74aea7b45219.poster.avif?t=1764515034\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/69a64e4e4e211a38893b74aea7b45219.webm?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/69a64e4e4e211a38893b74aea7b45219.mp4?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/5aacc9ee886fca385139cdcb101b2fe8.avif?t=1764515034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every aspect of your character can be freely customized\u2014appearance, stats, and class.<br>Change hairstyle, eye color, race, profession, and name to create your own warrior, mage, or archer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each race grants unique bonuses:<br>Elves and High Elves excel in magic, while Northern and Southern Rabbitfolk boast high speed and evasion.<br>Different professions influence stat growth and skills, allowing dramatically different playstyles.<br>Your customized hero is fully saved and reflected in combat, exploration, and even corruption events.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full customization of <strong>hair, eyes, outfit, class, and name</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Racial bonuses: Attack / Magic / Evasion etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine looks and power in a high-freedom system</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Companion System</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/01d73a23c34495afdb5ecf9b444db965.avif?t=1764515034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allies you encounter on the battlefield can join your party.<br>They are not mere NPCs\u2014they possess their own levels, gear, outfits, and stats.<br>Their growth and equipment are permanently saved and carried into future battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a companion is defeated, they may be captured\u2014triggering unique \u201ccorruption\u201d events.<br>Will you rescue them\u2026 or abandon them to their fate?<br>Your party composition and tactical choices determine not only victory, but the story itself.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions retain equipment / appearance / status</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique reactions during battle and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captured allies unlock exclusive event branches</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Group Battle System</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/6f205464511bf3bbfcfab32f420b2492.avif?t=1764515034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat isn\u2019t limited to 1-on-1 duels\u2014it\u2019s a <strong>real-time chaotic war</strong> involving dozens of units.<br>Command your allies to charge while you cast devastating magic from the rear\u2014or break through enemy lines to rescue captured slaves.<br>Every decision shapes the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the ruined depths beneath the Empire, rebels fight with their lives on the line.<br>Lead your squad, wield sword and sorcery, and survive the storm of carnage.<br>Your judgment decides who lives\u2026 and who is lost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Magic &amp; Elemental System</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/585a8280715c1961a34902d1b77159af.avif?t=1764515034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash destructive elemental sorcery\u2014<strong>Fire, Ice, Lightning, Wind, Poison, and Darkness</strong>.<br>Though defenseless while chanting, each spell delivers overwhelming power.<br>Burn, freeze, paralyze, and blast your foes away\u2014combine status effects and magic chains to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where <strong>beauty</strong> meets <strong>violence</strong>, experience the ecstasy of magical destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; Build System</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/745da5335f823c0d5153fc92298bc86a.avif?t=1764515034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 types of weapons to collect\u2014swords, axes, spears, bows, staves, daggers, and arcane tools.<br>Switch freely between melee or magic styles to suit your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run offers randomized weapon drops and power-up Buffs\u2014<br>build your own unique \u201cSurvival Loadout.\u201d<br>No two expeditions are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat Events &amp; The Training Facility</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/209cced9b7d86fb3327436eb67724957.avif?t=1764515034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who fall in battle are taken to the Empire\u2019s Training Facility\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a place that embodies absolute authority and reformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chains, rituals, and endurance trials test the limits of their body and spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even so, faint hope lingers within them\u2014a tragic beauty born from despair.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Fate of the Rebels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/0aab68cd0cadd0717992dbb2a0962b0b.avif?t=1764515034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>The fate of the characters you raised unfolds in real time before your eyes.<br>It is not defeat, but the \u201cproof\u201d of those who dared to resist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Captivity and Daily Humiliation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/f27ec9c2c49283517dfd4a2031501941.avif?t=1764515034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>Iron cages, chains, and the gaze of the crowd.<br>Prisoners stripped of dignity endure endless rituals of submission.<br>Yet somewhere deep within, a faint light of hope still flickers.<br>In this endless hell, can they truly keep their will alive?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Infiltration","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086970/fe4745ff37c4215140569adb8d73304b993b4223.jpg"},{"name":"Confronting the Princess","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086970/76b424fc54b0e36b40e92465e5893eef071e6a05.jpg"},{"name":"Witness to the Truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086970/67bfd3234cdbfc8dcfd6e3c2573dda91d8ed1aef.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Melee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086970/be7ee392388dea8367fd38f07aaee809c0c6bd2a.jpg"},{"name":"Marksman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086970/3744c5fd3a44a5d3298b8b602c480b585047b86b.jpg"},{"name":"Arcane Specialist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086970/76be2367a07a79ab60a4a60dd9be3c4a0a684ba3.jpg"},{"name":"Chain of Rescue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086970/011b3fa8e8f7ee500bdd9538c751d3a1cfa6e526.jpg"},{"name":"Awakening of the High Elf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086970/b113e3db81097ec8ea3a32f16b1d2d3604a6d30c.jpg"},{"name":"True Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086970/0a398db0631bc9a0999997d4cf8063c587020432.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086970?t=1764515034","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/7a312d5be6ec048297192dea981ad531d36a681a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764515034","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/96e734d68ddf91a2587f7a19ba2c86cf1343f542/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764515034","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/96e734d68ddf91a2587f7a19ba2c86cf1343f542/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764515034","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Nudity and Sexual Content:\r\nThis game contains explicit sexual content aimed at an adult audience. The specific themes included are:\r\n\r\nCross-Dressing: Characters depicted in cross-gender attire and roles, which is a significant aspect of the game's identity.\r\nUndressing and Nudity: Scenes involving characters being undressed, which lead to situations of explicit nudity.\r\nNon-Consensual Sexual Acts: Includes forced scenes that may involve rape or sexual coercion.\r\nForced Masturbation: Characters are depicted being compelled to masturbate, enhancing the game's intense scenarios.\r\nBondage and Suspension: Includes scenes where characters are restrained or suspended as part of the sexual content.\r\nWhipping: Characters are subjected to whipping, depicted in a controlled, animated context.\r\nDrugging: Characters are shown to be incapacitated via substances, leading to further non-consensual acts.\r\nOral Sex: Depictions of oral sexual acts are included as part of the game\u2019s mature content narrative.\r\nGagging: Scenes involving characters' mouths being obstructed as part of the sexual scenarios.\r\nTentacle Monsters: Additional explicit content involving tentacle creatures engaging in non-consensual acts with characters.\r\nContent Warning:\r\nThis game explores themes that might be considered extremely sensitive or disturbing to some audiences. All scenarios are fictional and are intended to provide a narrative experience within a fantasy context. All characters involved in mature content are depicted as over the age of 20.\r\nIntended Audience:\r\nThis game is intended for adults only. Players should be aware of the game's mature and explicit nature before purchasing or playing."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/11ddbb69d84cbae1733f72956ead6089.avif?t=1764515034\" width=1280 height=904 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><strong>Crossdresser Killer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cTo avenge his fallen clan, he donned women\u2019s clothing.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luna, the assassin\u2014<br>the last surviving High Elf and a man of striking beauty.<br>His forest burned, his homeland taken, his comrades defiled.<br>Now, his blade of vengeance pierces the heart of the Valdoria Empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dungeon-Crawling Roguelike Action RPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character freely and lead your companions through the hellish labyrinths of the fallen empire.<br>Fight, explore, capture, and liberate\u2014every choice you make shapes a new story and fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supported Languages:</strong> Japanese / English / Simplified Chinese / Traditional Chinese / Korean</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freely combine appearance, class, and name to create your own unique character.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/333538df6de1714c6bf2798b2c0819d8.poster.avif?t=1764515034\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/333538df6de1714c6bf2798b2c0819d8.webm?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/333538df6de1714c6bf2798b2c0819d8.mp4?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A chaotic real-time battle involving dozens. Cooperate with allies and survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/e2a66631e8c544468b0026e472f2109a.poster.avif?t=1764515034\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/e2a66631e8c544468b0026e472f2109a.webm?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/e2a66631e8c544468b0026e472f2109a.mp4?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A tense close-range battle where every move counts.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/af2c8b82668f978059a2b4c6b701b59f.poster.avif?t=1764515034\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/af2c8b82668f978059a2b4c6b701b59f.webm?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/af2c8b82668f978059a2b4c6b701b59f.mp4?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A magical barrier that blocks attacks and protects allies.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/d1efc1bc4ad5a138915e9a34a7efd2e7.poster.avif?t=1764515034\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/d1efc1bc4ad5a138915e9a34a7efd2e7.webm?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/d1efc1bc4ad5a138915e9a34a7efd2e7.mp4?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u5e1d\u56fd\u306e\u652f\u914d\u3092\u8c61\u5fb4\u3059\u308b\u65bd\u8a2d\u3002\u56da\u308f\u308c\u305f\u8005\u305f\u3061\u306f\u305d\u3053\u3067\u5c48\u670d\u306e\u5100\u5f0f\u3092\u53d7\u3051\u308b\u3002</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/67efee2a144bac4c49072c120d409461.poster.avif?t=1764515034\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/67efee2a144bac4c49072c120d409461.webm?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/67efee2a144bac4c49072c120d409461.mp4?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeated ones are displayed in the plaza as symbols of the Empire\u2019s rule.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/69a64e4e4e211a38893b74aea7b45219.poster.avif?t=1764515034\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/69a64e4e4e211a38893b74aea7b45219.webm?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/69a64e4e4e211a38893b74aea7b45219.mp4?t=1764515034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/5aacc9ee886fca385139cdcb101b2fe8.avif?t=1764515034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every aspect of your character can be freely customized\u2014appearance, stats, and class.<br>Change hairstyle, eye color, race, profession, and name to create your own warrior, mage, or archer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each race grants unique bonuses:<br>Elves and High Elves excel in magic, while Northern and Southern Rabbitfolk boast high speed and evasion.<br>Different professions influence stat growth and skills, allowing dramatically different playstyles.<br>Your customized hero is fully saved and reflected in combat, exploration, and even corruption events.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full customization of <strong>hair, eyes, outfit, class, and name</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Racial bonuses: Attack / Magic / Evasion etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine looks and power in a high-freedom system</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Companion System</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/01d73a23c34495afdb5ecf9b444db965.avif?t=1764515034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allies you encounter on the battlefield can join your party.<br>They are not mere NPCs\u2014they possess their own levels, gear, outfits, and stats.<br>Their growth and equipment are permanently saved and carried into future battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a companion is defeated, they may be captured\u2014triggering unique \u201ccorruption\u201d events.<br>Will you rescue them\u2026 or abandon them to their fate?<br>Your party composition and tactical choices determine not only victory, but the story itself.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions retain equipment / appearance / status</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique reactions during battle and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captured allies unlock exclusive event branches</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Group Battle System</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/6f205464511bf3bbfcfab32f420b2492.avif?t=1764515034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat isn\u2019t limited to 1-on-1 duels\u2014it\u2019s a <strong>real-time chaotic war</strong> involving dozens of units.<br>Command your allies to charge while you cast devastating magic from the rear\u2014or break through enemy lines to rescue captured slaves.<br>Every decision shapes the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the ruined depths beneath the Empire, rebels fight with their lives on the line.<br>Lead your squad, wield sword and sorcery, and survive the storm of carnage.<br>Your judgment decides who lives\u2026 and who is lost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Magic &amp; Elemental System</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/585a8280715c1961a34902d1b77159af.avif?t=1764515034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash destructive elemental sorcery\u2014<strong>Fire, Ice, Lightning, Wind, Poison, and Darkness</strong>.<br>Though defenseless while chanting, each spell delivers overwhelming power.<br>Burn, freeze, paralyze, and blast your foes away\u2014combine status effects and magic chains to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where <strong>beauty</strong> meets <strong>violence</strong>, experience the ecstasy of magical destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; Build System</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/745da5335f823c0d5153fc92298bc86a.avif?t=1764515034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 types of weapons to collect\u2014swords, axes, spears, bows, staves, daggers, and arcane tools.<br>Switch freely between melee or magic styles to suit your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run offers randomized weapon drops and power-up Buffs\u2014<br>build your own unique \u201cSurvival Loadout.\u201d<br>No two expeditions are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat Events &amp; The Training Facility</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/209cced9b7d86fb3327436eb67724957.avif?t=1764515034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who fall in battle are taken to the Empire\u2019s Training Facility\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a place that embodies absolute authority and reformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chains, rituals, and endurance trials test the limits of their body and spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even so, faint hope lingers within them\u2014a tragic beauty born from despair.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Fate of the Rebels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/0aab68cd0cadd0717992dbb2a0962b0b.avif?t=1764515034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>The fate of the characters you raised unfolds in real time before your eyes.<br>It is not defeat, but the \u201cproof\u201d of those who dared to resist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Captivity and Daily Humiliation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/extras/f27ec9c2c49283517dfd4a2031501941.avif?t=1764515034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>Iron cages, chains, and the gaze of the crowd.<br>Prisoners stripped of dignity endure endless rituals of submission.<br>Yet somewhere deep within, a faint light of hope still flickers.<br>In this endless hell, can they truly keep their will alive?</p>","developers":["FT Girl Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086970/ec029791be034358621fc89be1c5570d9cd39c77/header.jpg?t=1764515034","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9FTGirl Studio.All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4086970/1828180288/b47870fbd7068cbc90f7acc3bbf360f0bd7755af/1762160365/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762161073","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4086970/1828180288/b47870fbd7068cbc90f7acc3bbf360f0bd7755af/1762160365/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762161073","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/s